Ma75ICErtJQfM2QQ3zNkEM\"/><figcaption>被雪藏。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"被投閒置散後轉向電影圈發展。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1135987320349003776192056.jpeg/Jvr6AGLIY_sVMv5U4an5SqiYHv1ieNnyourT8qLq0_I\"/><figcaption>被投閒置散後轉向電影圈發展。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"袁詠儀在1991年接拍處境劇《我愛玫瑰園》，劇中她與男主角張兆輝本是怨家，但突然有一集劇集講述袁詠儀的角色愛上了對方。（《我愛玫瑰園》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250817/1033620797446557696493607.jpeg/yKwcbQasMi32vuRkvnUJofxbgBO9WwKoc9rFnnPaxZ4\"/><figcaption>袁詠儀在1991年接拍處境劇《我愛玫瑰園》，劇中她與男主角張兆輝本是怨家，但突然有一集劇集講述袁詠儀的角色愛上了對方。（《我愛玫瑰園》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"當年好靚女！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1135986893951995904243861.jpeg/Lb62YIOK6OHSTpDRPSjekDl3Vy8cVAludb1ujHW9bow\"/><figcaption>當年好靚女！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"當年好靚女！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1135986891670163456065873.jpeg/dlgYOFILpETpVyHNfXqvGowUJNkvOczVZYFTlGWBU5Q\"/><figcaption>當年好靚女！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好標緻。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1135986905025351680389612.jpeg/otsp6Mw_1uc9XwllcYEhGvfT2fSfbS2mr7-Pr6-_j68\"/><figcaption>好標緻。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好標緻。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1135986902701576192468053.jpeg/jQuJXw_0Npt55QC7ZaEqQ9_BiRbuRaBWsAhNWbAITVk\"/><figcaption>好標緻。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"出眾。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1135986900579127296630412.jpeg/3ZujI_1LXzp4ZxLalQGlhA6KaDJHQz6q74m_ge-Jv4E\"/><figcaption>出眾。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"出眾。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1135986898486038528479302.jpeg/ohiqqtXtd273aUy9NjK32xD0iMtG6Gum0fWABdH1gAU\"/><figcaption>出眾。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"出眾。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260526/1135986896011268096049268.jp